{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cao-retreat","title":"曹军退却，刘备与周瑜追击","order":274,"accounts":[{"id":"cao-retreat-account-1","label":"记载","text":"《周瑜传》记曹军退保南郡，刘备与周瑜等追击；曹操留曹仁等守江陵，自己北归。","evidence":["retreat"]},{"id":"cao-retreat-account-2","label":"记载","text":"《先主传》记刘备与吴军追到南郡，并提到疾疫及曹操引归。","evidence":["battle-shu"]},{"id":"cao-retreat-account-3","label":"记载","text":"裴注引《山阳公载记》称曹操从华容道步行撤军。","evidence":["retreat-shanyang"]},{"id":"wudi-e-o122c-account","label":"正文","text":"正文记赤壁战后大疫，曹军死亡多，曹操退军，刘备遂有荆州江南诸郡。","evidence":["wudi-e-o122c-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-p088a-account","label":"《山阳公载记》","text":"《山阳公载记》记曹操舰船被刘备焚烧，从华容道步行撤退，令羸兵负草填泥，死者甚众；刘备随后放火未及曹军。","evidence":["wudi-e-p088a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"退军北归","evidence":["retreat"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"追击","evidence":["retreat"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"追击","evidence":["retreat"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"留守江陵","evidence":["retreat"]}],"place":{"text":"南郡、江陵；华容道见裴注","evidence":["retreat","retreat-shanyang"]},"time":{"label":"建安十三年（208）","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"年次承接本篇建安十三年记事，现代注释释为公元 208 年；此条未记具体月日。","evidence":["year-original","year-modern","zhou-year","zhou-year-modern","allied-zhou","retreat"]}}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cao-ren","name":"曹仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"allied-zhou","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-df9e8a2d1c2855c608f2","quote":"权遂遣瑜及程普等，与备并力逆曹公，遇于赤壁。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"battle-shu","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-1846d8225e91af23e064","quote":"与曹公战于赤壁〖10〗；大破之，焚其舟船。先主与吴军水陆并进，追到南郡。时又疾疫，北军多死，曹公引归。","layer":"original","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"retreat","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-9cefd55fcd0518a1c94f","quote":"军遂败退，还保南郡。﹝二﹞备与瑜等复共追。曹公留曹仁等守江陵城，径自北归。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"retreat-shanyang","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1d0fe831aaf31892272a","quote":"公船舰为备所烧，引军从华容道，步归。","layer":"pei","attribution":"《山阳公载记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b1c5198aca732b51719e","start":13,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o122c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c35781bdeff07231cb61","layer":"original","quote":"于是大疫，吏士多死者。乃引军还，备遂有荆州江南诸郡〖17〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":664,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":66,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p088a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1d0fe831aaf31892272a","layer":"pei","quote":"《山阳公载记》曰：“公船舰为备所烧，引军从华容道，步归。遇泥泞，道不通。天又大风，悉使羸兵负草填之，骑乃得过。羸兵为人马所蹈藉，陷泥中，死者甚众。军既得出，公大喜；诸将问之，公曰：‘刘备，吾俦也，但得计少晚。向使早放火，吾徒无类矣！’备寻亦放火而无所及。","attribution":"《山阳公载记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b1c5198aca732b51719e","start":3,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-modern","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-original","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year-modern","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
